# The moteur's and the capot's NATIVE build outputs. None of it belongs in an image — the audio engine
# and the Tauri tray are per-machine binaries, and the web image builds from the
# workspace sources only. All are gitignored, so CI's fresh checkout never has
# them; this is what stops a LOCAL image build from shipping ~30GB of CMake and
# Cargo artifacts to the daemon as build context.
apps/moteur/build
apps/capot/out
apps/capot/.cache
apps/capot/src-tauri/target
apps/capot/src-tauri/binaries
apps/capot/src-tauri/resources
apps/capot/src-tauri/gen
